    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      219.05,
      397.17,
      243.95
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      249.41,
      397.18,
      284.75
    ],
    "text": "(a)to promote peace, goodwill, understanding andCooperation among all communities and people ofSri Lanka;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      294.41,
      397.16,
      317.75
    ],
    "text": "(b)to establish thakkiyas, Arabic TheologicalColleges and Orphanages for boys;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      327.41,
      397.19,
      410.75
    ],
    "text": "(c)to manage and run the institutions that are alreadyin existence such as Kattankudy MuhiyaddeenThakkiya, Kankeyanodai, Muhiyadeen Thakkiya(in Batticaloa District) Masjidur Riffaiyyi andArabic Theological College and Muslim Orpangethere is known as Madrasathul and Muslim Orpangein Kandy District;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      420.41,
      397.19,
      467.75
    ],
    "text": "(d)to Manage the establishments and Institutions thathave been founded by Seyyed Sheikh Koya Thangalthe Predecessor of present Spiritual leader SeyyedMohamed Buhary Nalla Koya Thangal;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      477.41,
      397.19,
      500.75
    ],
    "text": "(e)to promote the true creed of Islam as per SunnathulJamaath Doctrines;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      513.41,
      397.2,
      548.75
    ],
    "text": "(f)to foster the spirit of unity and to promote goodwilland friendship among Muslims and othercommunities;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      561.41,
      397.19,
      584.75
    ],
    "text": "(g)to organize public Religious Lectures on IslamicSubject;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      597.41,
      397.17,
      620.75
    ],
    "text": "(h)to work for the Religious and secular Educationalcurricula for the welfare of the Muslims;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
